# M8：ft-server 回滚演练（BJ）

2026-11-09 20:20 CST

## 步骤与输出

== 回滚演练：停服务 → 换回旧二进制 ==
systemctl stop ft-server
cp -a /opt/ft-server/ft-server.bak-20261109-metrics /opt/ft-server/ft-server
systemctl start ft-server
healthz: ok uptime=1s peers=0 relay_rooms=0
metrics code: 404          ← 旧二进制没有 /metrics，符合预期

== 恢复 0.8.0 ==
systemctl stop ft-server
install -m 0755 /tmp/ft-server-metrics2 /opt/ft-server/ft-server
systemctl start ft-server
healthz: ok uptime=1s peers=0 relay_rooms=0
metrics code: 200          ← 恢复后指标可用
ActiveState=active NRestarts=0

## 结论

- 回滚路径可用，单次中断约 1 s。
- 注意：服务运行中直接覆盖二进制会 `cp: cannot create regular file ...: Text file busy`，必须先 stop。
